{"product_id":"state-of-terror","title":"State of Terror","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the #1 bestselling authors Hillary Clinton and Louise Penny comes a novel of unsurpassed thrills and incomparable insider expertise - STATE OF TERROR.State of Terror follows a novice Secretary of State who has joined the administration of her rival, a president inaugurated after four years of American leadership that shrank from the world stage. A series of terrorist attacks throws the global order into disarray, and the secretary is tasked with assembling a team to unravel the deadly conspiracy, a scheme carefully designed to take advantage of an American government dangerously out of touch and out of power in the places where it counts the most.This high-stakes thriller of international intrigue features behind-the-scenes global drama informed by details only an insider could know.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 154 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Hillary Rodham Clinton | Louise Penny\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781529079708\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890736980121,"sku":"14RD9781529079708","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6915977c3ecf0_State_of_Terror.jpg?v=1763045054","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/state-of-terror","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}